{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/\u0434\u043e\u0431\u0430\u0432\u044c__2_.png?t=1746196254\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/Are_you_ready_to_reveal_the_secrets_of_an_old_antique_shop__Even_if_the_price_of_risk_is_your_life___1_.png?t=1746196254\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/\u0444\u0438\u0447\u0438__2_.png?t=1746196254\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/Anomalies.png?t=1746196254\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/\u041c\u043e\u043d\u0441\u0442\u0440\u044b__1_.gif?t=1746196254\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything used to be peaceful until an ancient artifact appeared in your shop. From that moment on, unexplainable things started happening. Strange fog, rustles and stares... It's like someone's staring at you from behind your back. Just try to survive and stay afloat, and don't turn back when you feel a breath from behind you, THEN RUN!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/Benefit_or_life_.png?t=1746196254\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/\u041f\u0435\u0440\u0441\u044b_2.gif?t=1746196254\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You should be careful when buying new and unusual \u201cstuff\u201d from now on. Who knows what you'll buy this time, an ordinary antique ring that you'll repair and resell x2 the price, or a cursed monk's skull that carries only death?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/Mysteries_of_the_shop.png?t=1746196254\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/\u041f\u0440\u043e\u0433\u0443\u043b\u043a\u0430_\u043f\u043e_\u043b\u0430\u0432\u043a\u0435__1_.gif?t=1746196254\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We've got it figured out, the main focus is to survive and avoid bankruptcy. But you still haven't solved that crazy mystery. Gods? Demons? Or the evil spirits of cursed things? Who have you enraged? Go and find out! Or die like the previous owner... It's up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/\u0414\u0438\u0441\u043a\u043e\u0440\u0434__1_.png?t=1746196254\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3660360?t=1746196254","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/ca8d4401fb8b4fda7ee29d5b1ac43cdeb11dfcc0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746196254","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/d52a7e3a36b76b2da013e29421017a818977b5d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746196254","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/d52a7e3a36b76b2da013e29421017a818977b5d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746196254","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset