es only death?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/Mysteries_of_the_shop.png?t=1746196254\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/\u041f\u0440\u043e\u0433\u0443\u043b\u043a\u0430_\u043f\u043e_\u043b\u0430\u0432\u043a\u0435__1_.gif?t=1746196254\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We've got it figured out, the main focus is to survive and avoid bankruptcy. But you still haven't solved that crazy mystery. Gods? Demons? Or the evil spirits of cursed things? Who have you enraged? Go and find out! Or die like the previous owner... It's up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/\u0414\u0438\u0441\u043a\u043e\u0440\u0434__1_.png?t=1746196254\" /></p>","developers":["La Luna Noire"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/5085a4c9c785b24ef6a3444dd184279bb6f523ec/header.jpg?t=1746196254","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257133268,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133268/movie480.mp4?t=1746194471","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133268/movie_max.mp4?t=1746194471"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer RU","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257133268/6f2c498a0faecd6659dbabaac287e09327b039a7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746194471","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133268/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746194471","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133268/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746194471"}}],"name":"Deadly Deals","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements"